  <h1>Cookidoo: The TM7's Recipe Platform</h1>
  <p class="lede">Cookidoo is what turns the TM7 from a powerful appliance into a guided, step-by-step cooking system. Here's what it actually does, what it costs, and whether you need it.</p>
</section>

<img class="comparison-image" src="/images/cookidoo-transfer-recipe.jpg" alt="Sending a Leek and Potato Soup recipe from the Cookidoo phone app to the TM7 touchscreen with a single tap" loading="lazy">

<h2 class="section-heading">What Is Cookidoo?</h2>
<p>Cookidoo is Vorwerk's official recipe platform — think of it as the TM7's operating system for recipes. Rather than reading a recipe and guessing at heat and timing yourself, you pull a recipe up on Cookidoo and the TM7 receives the instructions directly: it sets its own time, temperature, and speed for every single step, and tells you exactly what to add and when.</p>
<p>It's not limited to the TM7's touchscreen, either — Cookidoo runs as a website and a mobile app, so you can browse and plan recipes from your phone on the bus, then send them to the machine once you're home.</p>

